{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211110","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321111001:1":{"text":"すみません、職人さん。一度は行ってみたい場所ってありますか？","source_cn":"打扰一下，工匠先生。你有没有非常向往的地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x081D256707316A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321111002:1":{"text":"ハハ、あらゆる最先端の機器が揃った研究所があれば行ってみたいかな。そんな場所があれば、面白い発明がたくさんできそうだからね！","source_cn":"哈，要是有一个材料齐全、有各种最先进机械的研究所，我肯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x971E27617DAC240C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321111003:1":{"text":"まさか、ドワーフ職人の夢を応援するために、研究所を建ててくれるのかい？","source_cn":"怎么，雪松镇准备支持我们这群矮人的梦想，建一个机械研究所？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D7C527BFEC9BFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321111004:1":{"text":"いえ、そういうわけじゃ……ちょっと聞いてみただけで。","source_cn":"啊……这倒不是，我只是随口问问。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91580581CAE3A0DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321111005:1":{"text":"はぁ……やっと話が通じたのかと思ったら、ただのぬか喜びか……","source_cn":"我还以为你们突然开窍了呢，真是白兴奋一场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E85407821E8C54D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321111006:1":{"text":"他に用がないならさっさと行ってくれ。俺はこの機器を直さなきゃいけないんだ。","source_cn":"没什么事就一边玩去吧，我还得研究这台机器。要是没了它，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB70230CE8801723F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321111007:1":{"text":"うーん……公国の最も美しい景色が、研究所なはずないですよね……","source_cn":"呃……不管怎么想，白山公国的最美风景都不可能是机械研究...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5BE5C50E465D2C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321111008:1":{"text":"この方の意見も参考にならなそうです。他の人に聞いてみましょう！","source_cn":"看来这次获得的答案没什么帮助。我们再去问问其他人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDC6AF76752D39BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:娜塔莎":{"text":"ナターシャ","source":"娜塔莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:沉思的矮人工匠":{"text":"考え込むドワーフ職人","source":"沉思的矮人工匠","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":4}}